    "region": "all",
    "source_url": "https://www.drikpanchang.com/vrats/ekadashidates.html"
   },
   {
    "text": "The moon is sighted through a sieve.",
    "basis": "custom",
    "region": "all",
    "source_url": "https://www.drikpanchang.com/vrats/ekadashidates.html"
   },
   {
    "text": "The fast is broken after moonrise.",
